astral-upscale.patch provenance

The NX_UPSCALE / NX_UPSCALE_SHARPNESS selection (runtime/src/nvn/nvn_upscale.h), the launcher's Upscaling setting
and the tests are original work. The patch carries context from the pinned public runtime (SuperMarioWonderRecomp
at 010ed7a596a621c15d3a8dfa5795ca8c3668b066).

The patch adds no shader code. The FSR 1 passes it switches on are the pinned runtime's own: tools/shaders/fsr/
easu.frag and rcas.frag (compiled into runtime/src/nvn/nvn_fsr_spirv.inc and used by runtime/src/nvn/nvn_present.cpp,
MIT, see SuperMarioWonderRecomp's LICENSE in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md), a GLSL port after AMD FidelityFX Super
Resolution 1.0 (EASU and RCAS), which is distributed under the MIT licence:

